flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Read user ID and selected account type]
    B --> C{User ID empty?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Show user ID error]
    C -- No --> E[Create ValidationService]
    E --> F{User ID valid?}
    F -- No --> G[Show invalid user ID]
    F -- Yes --> H{Account type valid?}
    H -- No --> I[Show invalid account type]
    H -- Yes --> J{User exists?}
    J -- No --> K[Show user does not exist]
    J -- Yes --> L[Create Admin model]
    L --> M[Call createClientAccount]
    M --> N[Show success message]
    D --> O[End]
    G --> O
    I --> O
    K --> O
    N --> O
